{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/multiplayer_ship_ride.gif?t=1741157219\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/SAIL_COLLECT_SURVIVE.png?t=1741157219\" /><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A co-op horror game where teams of up to 4 players sail cursed waters to collect treasures for a mysterious organization.</p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/shipincoming.gif?t=1741157219\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/THE_CURSED_EXPEDITION.png?t=1741157219\" /><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Navigate treacherous waters between haunted islands with your crew</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Wield lanterns to light your way and weapons to face what lurks in the darkness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Collect valuable artifacts and bring them back to your ship before time runs out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Use proximity voice chat that fades with distance, creating natural tension</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Work together to repair your vessel or risk sinking into the depths forever</p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/cavewalkinggif-.gif?t=1741157219\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/TREASURES_and_DANGERS.png?t=1741157219\" /><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your ship is your only sanctuary in these treacherous waters. The deeper you venture, the more valuable the treasures\u2014and the deadlier the threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Lurking Horrors:</strong> Unsettling atmosphere, dynamic audio, and darkness test your courage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Your Vessel:</strong> A floating haven that carries you between haunted destinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Ancient Secrets:</strong> Each successful expedition unlocks new territories and challenges</p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/shipsinking.gif?t=1741157219\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/STRENGTH_IN_NUMBERS.png?t=1741157219\" /><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will your crew stand united against the horrors that lurk below, or will the dark waters claim yet another vessel? In these cursed seas, death is merely the beginning.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3022470?t=1741157219","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/4d645db93f11892fe61e6a5403fb7f60f30880ca/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741157219","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/e1090337327bd4170a11f67251bebae41e27c1da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741157219","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/e1090337327bd4170a11f67251bebae41e27c1da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741157219","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Merchants of Dark includes mild violence, frightening scenes, and dark themes. Players will encounter skeletons, corpses, and tense, eerie settings."},"detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/multiplayer_ship_ride.gif?t=1741157219\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/